COMMENT     Route: dual: A cytosolic + B lysosomal
COMMENT     Asks: Dual route from one transcript: A to the
            proteasome, B to the endolysosome. Note E5 is internal
            here, upstream of P2A, so it has no free C-terminus and
            is expected to be weak.
COMMENT     Blunt-ligate into pJET1.2 in either orientation; recover the IVT
            template by PCR with IVT_F and IVT_R.
